      "id": "claim_e9cb097dc5e143fc9f4f279e722e609f",
      "statement": "New PRs are created through `open_pull_request`, which resolves a scoped user OAuth token when an author login is available and otherwise uses the GitHub App installation token; a user-token operation can be refused for a repository outside the workspace App installation or by the consent gate.",
